      "system": {
        "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Laser guns are high-tech weapons which emit a concentrated beam of coherent, directional light, intense enough to inflict serious damage. They were a relatively new development in the years before the Great War, and thus are not an especially common sight in the wasteland, outside of those groups who&rsquo;ve secured old military weapons caches. Most surviving models of laser gun&mdash;such as the dependable AER9, widely used by the U. S. Army&mdash;use an internal capacitor charged by a microfusion power cell.</span></p>",
